{"id": "EUVD-2026-72352", "enisaUuid": "166f20e5-d15f-3e0f-bacb-d92583d85eae", "description": "EAP's Artemis deserialization configuration permits deserialization by default. ObjectMessage.getObject() uses ObjectInputStreamWithClassLoader, which implements allow-list/block-list filtering via its checkSecurity()/isTrustedType() method. However, by default both allow-list and block-list are empty. When the allow-list is empty (size == 0), isTrustedType() returns true for ALL classes. This means all classes are deserializable by default.", "datePublished": "2026-09-07T11:35:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T17:00:12", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:53645", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:53646", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70228", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70229", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70230", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70277", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-86404", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2477930"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-86404", "GHSA-q97r-w4hq-94gr"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.73, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0049f806-33a0-3959-ad25-e9457a898267", "product": {"name": "Red Hat JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 7.4 ELS on RHEL 8", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0:2.5.5-24.SP12_redhat_00016.1.el8eap"}, {"id": "0133d527-c3de-319f-b22d-ce4431ae03a1", "product": {"name": "Red Hat JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 8.1 for RHEL 10", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0:2.25.4-1.redhat_00003.1.el10eap"}, {"id": "0137ebb4-4a58-3078-b65d-48e69c60c6f1", "product": {"name": "Red Hat JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 8.1 for RHEL 9", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0:2.40.0-8.redhat_00024.1.el9eap"}, {"id": "02761218-102a-3dd2-84d